    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκῑρόομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>become hard</i> or
				<i>dry</i> through age, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσκιρωμένης
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκηρ</span>- cod.)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: πεπαλαιωμένης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. eund.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσκληκότα</span>
			 (ubi-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκληρ</span>- cod.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			pf.inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσκιρῶσθαι</span> (sic cod. Patm.,
				-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκειρῶ</span>- cod. <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελευκάνθαι</span>
			, Apollod.Hist.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				107
			</span></i>(c) <i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσκυρῶσθαι</span>
			eodem sensu).</div>
